<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n54603" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατανείφω</span></b> , fut.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-νείψω</span> (v. infr.), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>snow all over, cover with snow</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατένειψε Χιόνι τὴν Θρᾴκην</span>
				[<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ θεός</span>], i.e. <i>snow fell
				over all</i> Thrace, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ach.</u>
				138
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Luc.</u>
				24
			</span></i>: metaph., <i>sprinkle as with snow</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>VH</u>
				2.14
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατανείψων ἀπὸ γλώσσης ἅπαντας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Lex.</u>
					15
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> abs.,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατανείφει</span>
			<i>it snows</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κεἰ κριμνώδη
			κατανείφοι</span> even <i>were it to snow</i> thick as meal,
				<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Nu.</u>
				965
			</span></i>.</div>
